---
// "In 30 seconds" callout with a gold border.
---
<aside
  class="my-6 rounded-[12px] border-2 border-gold/60 bg-gold/5 px-5 py-4"
>
  <p class="m-0 mb-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-gold">
    ⚡ In 30 seconds
  </p>
  <div class="text-[1.02rem] leading-relaxed text-text [&_p]:m-0 [&_p+p]:mt-2">
    <slot />
  </div>
</aside>
